{"id":2948,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>盛夏离别意，浓浓师生情。6月15日下午4时，院长王黎明、党委副书记兼副院长么兰、副院长陈友兴及各系主任、辅导员、班主任深入毕业生宿舍，亲切看望慰问2026届毕业生。</p><p>走访中，院领导与同学们亲切交流，详细了解就业去向、升学结果及离校准备情况，认真听取对学院发展的建议，并协调解决实际困难。院领导寄语毕业生永葆终身学习的态度，坚定理想信念，锤炼过硬本领，常回母校看看。</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;同学们满怀不舍与感恩，表示将秉承“修德立信，笃行通达”的院训，在新征程上脚踏实地、奋勇争先。此次走访不仅保障了毕业生安全文明离校，更让学子们在离别之际深切感受到学院的温暖与牵挂，为大学生活画上温情圆满的句号。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UMzfnfMR9DnzQfMSNCDL8-iUlL8L8Wz7L4-8U4UanNnVMzL0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhfnSyDnSysLzVRo7QRnm94U4G4M7Q7M8MVL7UZM4vsMlnFUmLsMmCsoRrFMlr7M47Jv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZMRUbgtA8pUlcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18449&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CAE6E711C8FCF83C034FD7CE0D87775D/B3766785/5ED71\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 357px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UMzfnfMR9DnzQfMSNCDL8-iUlL8L8Wz7L4-8U4UanNnVMzL0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhfnSyDnSysLzVRo7QRnm94U4G4M7Q7M8MVL7UZM4vsMlnFUmLsMmCsoRrFMlr7M47Jv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZMRUbgtA8pUlcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18449&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ULlCnDoRnkLlUPUS8VVUz-iM4GiUNrzRnmnkL8UDUmNiLNL0gihFp2hmCIa0M1ybn1yPM1hfnRlDLzGsLRUZLm7PMzUiMmN4ozCso7rRUznFnlLinzNanRWFMl7sn7lJv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZMRUbgtA8pUlcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18449&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/69F16AD561070482115456939678ECA4/EC5E90D2/5A7DE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 358px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ULlCnDoRnkLlUPUS8VVUz-iM4GiUNrzRnmnkL8UDUmNiLNL0gihFp2hmCIa0M1ybn1yPM1hfnRlDLzGsLRUZLm7PMzUiMmN4ozCso7rRUznFnlLinzNanRWFMl7sn7lJv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZMRUbgtA8pUlcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18449&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UUzCnDMR9bnlCsUSNM7L7-4ozTkUzrz2nN-DnmA2Ul7PMRG0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yaokysokybolCYMz7bLR-iLmWfn7CsM4UPnmv4M4vZLRVFM4nkLm7ZnNVFM7LPM7UJv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZMRUbgtA8pUlcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18449&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F087899F251902522ADF7741F7377801/74B218FA/4C14D\" vheig